BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-12-21T22:45:00&endDate=2026-12-22T01:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nWEAVER LINE: Monday 21 and Tuesday 22 December\, after 2245 each evening\, no service between Hackney Downs and Chingford. Last through trains operate at 2231 from Liverpool Street and at 2253 from Chingford. Replacement bus service L3 operates between Hackney Downs and Chingford via Clapton\, St James Street\, Walthamstow Central\, Wood Street and Highams Park. The last three northbound buses operate from Liverpool Street at 0014 0044 and 0114 and also call at Bethnal Green\, Cambridge Heath and London Fields (Mare Street)
DTEND:20261222T012900Z
DTSTART:20261221T224500Z
SUMMARY:Weaver line: Part Closure
UID:d8f9705a-5cb4-4d83-9731-ddc73cd1ee7f@d8f9.org
END:VEVENT
